ie-about_2-text st-m-heading st-d-heading se-rc">+</h2></div><div data-sid="about_3" class="sie-about_3 se" style="display: none;"><div class="se-simple"></div></div><div data-sid="about_4" class="sie-about_4 se" style="transform: scale(1, 1) translate(264px);"><p class="se-t sie-about_4-text st-m-paragraph st-d-paragraph se-rc">Hi! Iâ€™m Mia Oâ€™Malley, and if youâ€™re here your story is probably much like my own.<br></p></div><div data-sid="about_5" class="sie-about_5 se" style="transform: scale(1, 1) translate(264px);"><p class="se-t sie-about_5-text st-m-paragraph st-d-paragraph se-rc">Whether you are here because you are plus size and expecting a baby, or perhaps you are looking to embrace your plus size body, need size-friendly babywearing tips, looking to learn how to advocate for yourself with your care provider or maybe you are here because you like my style - whatever the reason might be - know that I am <i>so</i> happy you are here!</p></div><div data-sid="about_6" class="sie-about_6 se" style="transform: scale(1, 1) translate(264px) rotate(-6deg);"><h2 class="se-t sie-about_6-text st-m-heading st-d-heading se-rc">Let's be friends!</h2></div></div></div></div><div id="gradient-1" data-bid="gradient-1" class="sb sib-gradient-1" style="height: 11px;"><div class="ss-s ss-bg"><div class="sc" style="width:1200px"><div data-sid="gradient-1_0" class="sie-gradient-1_0 se" style="width: 1728px; transform: scale(1, 1) translate(-264px);"><div class="se-simple"></div></div><div data-sid="gradient-1_1" class="sie-gradient-1_1 se" style="width: 1728px; transform: scale(1, 1) translate(-264px);"><div class="se-simple"></div></div><div data-sid="gradient-1_2" class="sie-gradient-1_2 se" style="width: 1728px; transform: scale(1, 1) translate(-264px);"><div class="se-simple"></div></div></div></div></div></div>
    
